// Sum of the winning labeled hammings that appear on at least two kept pairs.
// A hamming that appears once adds nothing. A repeated hamming is added again.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hrsum ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hrsum rank

IMPULSE hrsum 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hrsum" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
